{title: Doxology}
{artist: Thomas Ken}
{key: G}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Praise God, from [D]whom all [Em]blessings [D]flow;
[G]Praise Him, all [C]creatures [D]here be[G]low;
[G]Praise Him a[D]bove, ye [Em]heavenly [D]host;
[G]Praise Father, [C]Son, and [D]Holy [G]Ghost.
{end_of_verse}
